### ==============================================================================
### Multi-Tenant AI Inference Platform - REST API Scratchpad
### Extension: humao.rest-client (VS Code)
###
### INSTRUCTIONS:
### Each section below is an end-to-end USE CASE CYCLE.
### You can run each request in a cycle top-to-bottom sequentially.
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@tenantId = tenant-default
@apiKey = dev-secret-key

