### ==============================================================================

# 0.1 Fetch Machine-Readable OpenAPI 3.0 Specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/json

###

# 0.2 Check Swagger UI HTML Endpoint (or open in browser: http://localhost:3000/docs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs/

###

# 0.3 Verify Documentation Aliases Redirects (/documentation -> /docs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documentation

###

### ==============================================================================
### USE CASE 1: Platform Health & Dependency Verification
### Verify that Fastify API, PostgreSQL, MinIO (S3), and ElasticMQ (SQS) are ready
### ==============================================================================

# 1.1 Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

###

